          "es": "Entonces Atum hizo a los dos primeros dioses.",
          "en": "So Atum made the first two gods."
        },
        {
          "es": "Estornudó, y salió Shu, el dios del aire.",
          "en": "He sneezed, and out came Shu, the god of air."
        },
        {
          "es": "Escupió, y salió Tefnut, la diosa de la humedad.",
          "en": "He spat, and out came Tefnut, the goddess of moisture."
        },
        {
          "es": "Atum los rodeó con sus brazos, para que su vida estuviera en ellos.",
          "en": "Atum put his arms around them, so that his life would be in them."
        }
