        },
        {
          "es": "Cuando Atum los volvió a ver, lloró por ellos.",
          "en": "When Atum saw them again, he cried over them."
        },
        {
          "es": "Sus lágrimas cayeron, y de esas lágrimas nacieron las primeras personas.",
          "en": "His tears fell, and from those tears the first people were born."
        },
        {
          "es": "Así llegaron las personas al mundo: de las lágrimas de Atum.",
          "en": "That is how people came into the world: from the tears of Atum."
