        {
          "es": "Pero el Ojo se enojó. Mientras no estaba, Atum se había hecho un ojo nuevo.",
          "en": "But the Eye was angry. While it was away, Atum had made a new eye."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces Atum le dio un lugar más alto: en su frente, como una cobra.",
          "en": "So Atum gave it a higher place: on his forehead, as a cobra."
        },
        {
          "es": "Desde ahí, el Ojo gobernó toda la tierra.",
          "en": "From there, the Eye ruled over the whole land."
        },
        {
          "es": "Por eso los reyes de Egipto llevaban una cobra en la corona.",
          "en": "That is why the kings of Egypt wore a cobra on their crown."
