      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Así, Atum se paró sobre la primera tierra e hizo a los primeros dioses.",
          "en": "So Atum stood on the first land and made the first gods."
        },
        {
          "es": "Sus lágrimas hicieron a las primeras personas, y su Ojo se volvió la cobra de su frente.",
          "en": "His tears made the first people, and his Eye became the cobra on his forehead."
        },
        {
          "es": "Más tarde, Shu y Tefnut tuvieron dos hijos: Geb, el dios de la tierra, y Nut, la diosa del cielo.",
          "en": "Later, Shu and Tefnut had two children: Geb, the earth god, and Nut, the sky goddess."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los dos estaban pegados, sin ningún espacio entre ellos.",
          "en": "The two lay pressed together, with no space between them."
        },
        {
          "es": "En el próximo episodio, Shu los separa.",
          "en": "In the next episode, Shu pushes them apart."
        }
